ME = (f"`mutacoes/leva{N}.py` ({tot}, {VIA_EN}): {ac} caught. {lac_en} {PS_EN}"
      f"{RES_EN} Fix after the chain (2026-10-31): the passar_a_oferta_aos_clubes copy (cpv_1) called 0x8c7470 as stdcall, but it is thiscall (ecx = the transfer manager); the this went with whatever ecx held and, sometimes 0, crashed the following batches career in 0x8c7560. Batch 260 chain, with batch 258 integrated, covers the fix.")
